(label "GND" (at 162.56 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "42fe1f46-7f9a-5598-be67-09e69d1a21b6"))
(text "J1/J2 are physical female sockets. Pin 1 is nearest USB.\nJ2 pins are numbered top-to-bottom, not module DIP order.\n15.24 mm row spacing; 2.54 mm pitch. No carrier 5V connection." (at 25.4 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ae6e9e00-e009-5361-9cf6-1f930c7e857c"))
(text "R1: remove to isolate / measure display supply.\nHold RESET low and CS high before SPI starts.\nGPIO19=SCK, GPIO18=MOSI; start at 1 MHz.\nPower off Wi-Fi before refresh." (at 25.4 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "739593dd-e177-5094-bd0a-ef2e6b795422"))
(text "Boost controlled by UC8179 through GDR / RESE.\nQ1: 1=gate, 2=source, 3=drain. D1-D3: 1=cathode.\nKelvin pickup on RESE; short SW loop; 50V bias MLCCs.\nReference: Good Display GDEY075T7 rev1.0 p40." (at 162.56 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f3ce5e27-39b4-5351-a372-bc3c1bd274a8"))
(text "Pin 4 is NC. Pin 5 VSHR is NOT pin 21 PREVGH.\nPin 18 VDD_INTERNAL receives only C6, never external 3V3.\nTSCL / TSDA / VPP unused per reference. BS1=GND.\nCheck flex orientation before inserting the panel." (at 309.88 119.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3deddb95-d3c6-500d-b551-e374c9050cf4"))
(text "All rail capacitors non-polar MLCC. Bias-dependent capacitance must be checked against the exact panel lot.\nNo high-voltage rail is an external supply input. Fit panel and module only after inspection / resistance checks." (at 25.4 245.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "619460be-bd8e-5b4e-8440-1dab12c66ff5"))
(text "Four M2.5 non-plated holes. USB supply 5V / >=1A.\nSMT top side only; sockets hand-soldered after reflow." (at 25.4 263 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "344614a8-9b94-5dfd-bdc2-3f84e19b8ec8")))
